title: "The AI Triangle"
abstract: >-
  The AI Triangle is a practitioner-facing project management triangle,
  published by Brian Rain in 2026, in which Quality is fixed and means the
  human's discernment is still intact, and the three trade variables are
  continuous improvement disciplines the practitioner imposes on themselves:
  continuous improvement of self, of their AI tools, and of new AI.
